{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Reject unsupported payload-envelope versions.** A value beginning `@aws-durable-payload:v2:` does not match the exact v1 prefix and is passed to user SerDes as a legacy payload. A custom codec can silently consume unsupported protocol data despite the documented fail-closed contract. Detect the reserved `@aws-durable-payload:` marker and reject unsupported or malformed versions before invoking SerDes; add direct and framed-input tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7odijF","finding_digest":"cf1d27e63aed5623c29814e7c352f4a5c37566dcdafbe5f45072639a1b8b239a","finding_id":"arf_v1_z4ospzr25vlchquyctt4guxuux","finding_key":"sdk/execution/payloadcodec::resolve::unsupported-envelope-version-fail-open","identity_key":"sdk/execution/payloadcodec::resolve::unsupported-envelope-version-fail-open","line":145,"observation_digest":"b6c2e16168af3187cf48f4a19fc9f001516213ed22211c00cf66c1e0a39615a6","observation_id":"aro_v1_w3bocyliv4yypt2i6sqz7spqaf","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/PayloadCodec.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_z4ospzr25vlchquyctt4guxuux","published_at":"2026-09-01T01:51:59Z","review_id":"arr_v1_3bnlauo2m2c6d5ixh7746eioeo","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"8eef84f0497a396cb2089093bab4bb337100a387","reviewer":"codex","start_line":145,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_ltjpb66zfykzeoimvqnsvbrttm","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T01:51:59Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
